---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const jsonLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'WebPage',
  name: 'Research Use Disclaimer',
  description: 'Research-use restrictions and website-information disclaimer for products supplied by Shandong Shengyuan Peptide Technology Co., Ltd.',
};

---

<BaseLayout
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
  title="Research Use Disclaimer | Shengyuan Peptide"
  description="All products supplied by Shandong Shengyuan Peptide Technology Co., Ltd. are strictly for laboratory research and development — prohibited uses, buyer responsibilities, and the limits of quality documentation."
>
  <div class="wrap article-shell">
    <div class="article-header">
      <h1>Research Use Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="lede">Please read this disclaimer carefully before ordering.</p>
    </div>
    <article>
      <h2>Research Use Only</h2>
      <p>
        All products sold by Shandong Shengyuan Peptide Technology Co., Ltd. are manufactured and
        supplied <strong>strictly for laboratory research and development use</strong>. They are not
        intended for human or veterinary use, nor for diagnostic or therapeutic purposes.
      </p>

      <h2>Prohibited Uses</h2>
      <p>The following uses are prohibited for every product listed on this platform:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Human consumption, injection, or topical application</li>
        <li>Veterinary use outside approved laboratory protocols</li>
        <li>Compounding, dispensing, or resale as a medicine, supplement, cosmetic, or food ingredient</li>
        <li>Use in any clinical or diagnostic setting involving humans or animals</li>
        <li>Any use violating applicable law in the buyer's or destination jurisdiction</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Orders placed for prohibited uses will not be processed, and confirmed orders found to violate
        these restrictions are subject to the resolution terms in the
        <a href="/terms/">Terms &amp; Conditions</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>No Medical or Professional Advice</h2>
      <p>
        Nothing on this website constitutes medical, clinical, legal, regulatory, or professional
        advice, and our team does not provide dosing guidance, usage instructions for human
        application, or recommendations of any kind regarding self-administration. By purchasing, you
        confirm that you are a qualified researcher or institution acquiring materials for legitimate
        scientific purposes.
      </p>

      <h2>Buyer Responsibilities</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Ensure your use complies with all applicable laws and regulations in your jurisdiction.</li>
        <li>Handle, store, and dispose of products in accordance with your institution's safety protocols.</li>
        <li>Hold the appropriate licenses and import permits where required.</li>
        <li>Maintain suitable facilities, qualified personnel, and recordkeeping for your research.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Regulatory Status</h2>
      <p>
        Products listed on this website are research compounds. They are not medicines, not approved
        therapeutics, and not dietary supplements. References to research literature or chemical
        properties are provided for compound identification only and do not imply fitness for any
        human or veterinary application.
      </p>

      <h2>Quality Documentation and Its Limits</h2>
      <p>
        Products are manufactured to research-grade standards and released with a Certificate of
        Analysis covering HPLC purity, mass spectrometry identity, and peptide content. Research-grade
        production is not produced under pharmaceutical GMP for clinical use, and no warranty of
        fitness for any particular purpose is made beyond the analytical data provided. A purity
        result does not establish sterility, endotoxin status, biological activity, or suitability for
        any clinical application.
      </p>

      <h2>Specifications and Availability</h2>
      <p>
        Products are supplied against the specification shown on the applicable product page. The
        standard catalog purity specification is ≥98% unless otherwise stated. Product-specific
        specifications and quality-control information may vary by compound and batch; batch release
        data can be verified through the <a href="/coa/">COA lookup</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this disclaimer: <a href="mailto:aaron@shengyuanpeptides.com">aaron@shengyuanpeptides.com</a>
        or WhatsApp +64 2102668969.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
